# Prairie Dog (2/2 lifelink): "At the beginning of your end step, if you haven't cast a spell from your hand this turn, put a +1/+1
# counter on this creature" (CR 603.4). Turn 1 it is cast from the hand (and two Moxen), so no counter at that end step. On turn 3
# nothing is cast: it attacks, lifelink gains 2 (CR 702.15b) for Bot1 as Bot2 loses 2, and at the end step it grows to 3/3. On turn 5
# Bot1 casts Memnite from its hand, so it stays 3/3.

